Package: GreedyMiner
Type: Package
Title: Structured Discovery of Dependencies in Tabular Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Damian", "Panas", email = "damian@panas.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Screens mixed-type data for pairwise and joint dependence,
    predictive information, conditional associations, interactions and
    subgroup rules. Separates discovery from confirmation, tracks the
    search budget, adjusts multiple tests and reports diagnostics.
    Base R implementations are supplemented by optional model backends.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, parallel, splines, tools, methods
Suggests: mgcv, glmnet, ranger, partykit, arules, energy
